Joins your images in a fast and simple way.

Features: 
- on loading, select the image resolution (high/medium/low);
- expand or reduce the image size; 
- join multiple images;
- blend your images making transparent the edges; 
- move the selected image in front or back of other images; 
- crop the image; 
- "snap to grid" function; 
- undo/redo your modify;
- on ending, the resulting image are automatically trimmed and the transparent border/contour is removed;
- save the resulting image and share it.
